    "Id": "chassisdef_tessen_TSN-X-4",
    "Name": "Tessen",
    "Details": "This Tessen variant developed by ComStar Adept Simon Lowenstein drops the ferro-fibrous armor for Light Ferro-Fibrous. It also removes the C3 and electronics systems of the standard version and replaces them with a Bloodhound Active Probe and Angel ECM Suite. The iNARC system has been replaced by a C3 slave and a remote sensor dispenser.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
